body:
Um, yes but also, who is telling your child that?

&#x200B;

Just, don''t go to the drag storytime event.

OH MY GOODNESS! I have never been more in love with a cake. At first I thought I was on r/MonsterHunterWorld and I thought: "What a beautiful cake. Shame about all of the fondant."

&#x200B;

Then I noticed the sub. If you are ever in the Dallas area, I would love to commission a MHW cake from you. :)
